Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}《老友记》 前情提要{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Previously on Friends:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你居然不能去  是啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't believe you won't be there. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.15,0:00:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么不能请两天假{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why can't you take a couple of days off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.11,0:00:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不行  这是我的婚礼{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because I can't. This is my wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.45,0:00:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真想赶快看到婚礼场地  她父母就在那里结婚{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So,I can't wait to see this place you're getting married! Emily's parents got married here.{\r}
