Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我只知道延期是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The only thing I understand is postponing is not an option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我跟你讲  我们不会结婚了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I tell you, this wedding is not gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}要是你不喜欢  我们就改地点  改时间  真的没关系{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}If you don't love this, then we'll do it any other place or any other time. Really, it's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这样很完美{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要去伦敦  什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm going to London. What?{\r}
