Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.37,0:01:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我是菲比布非{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, this is Phoebe Buffay.{\r}
