Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我恐怕没有权利泄露这个信息{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm afraid I'm not at liberty to divulge that information.{\r}
