Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.35,0:02:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}抱歉迟到了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, sorry, we're late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是我不好   我坚持要坐那个铁管子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My fault. I insisted on riding the tube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}茱蒂   孩子都在{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Judy, the kids!{\r}
