Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}和安瑞亚华森{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and Andrea Waltham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们好  幸会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How do you do? Very nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}老婆  是盖勒家的人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ha, ha! Eh, darling, the Gellers.{\r}
