Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她只想着自己  早知道  不该娶她的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's very self-absorbed, you know. I should never have married her.{\r}
