Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在哪里   这是其中一个  那是另外一个{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Where? That's one and that's another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}很高兴认识你们{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Lovely to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢谢你们愿意出一半的钱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Terribly nice of you to offer to pay for half the wedding.{\r}
