Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们知道结个婚要花多少钱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, we know how expensive weddings can be.{\r}
